  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development diplomacy in the secondary education sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is supporting a technical expert to work directly with the newly established secondary education directorate to support policy planning and strategy and include a flexible fund to support strategic activities in response to policy needs and opportunities. The project also aims to harness the broader set of UK investments in education and leverage opportunities for UK policy engagement</narrative>
  </description>
